{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Sauna Simulator&quot; is a funny business simulator. Buy premises, equip them with a sauna </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stove and start earning from it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You inherit a sauna stove and decide to open your own sauna business. You have a </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >large area at your disposal, divided into rooms, which you can buy and put there any </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >stove from the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/58581f4e5507630dd14e522f1858b21e.poster.avif?t=1771570919\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/58581f4e5507630dd14e522f1858b21e.webm?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/58581f4e5507630dd14e522f1858b21e.mp4?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While your business is small, you will do all the work yourself: please customers, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clean the room, put firewood in the sauna stove. However, as your sauna expands, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >you'll be able to hire employees to take care of all the chores you don't want to do.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers leave feedback. If your customers don't like your sauna: poor service, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >dirty facilities, etc., they will definitely leave a bad review. If, on the other hand, you take </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >complete care of your customers, they will leave you a positive rating. Based on these </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ratings, you will see the average rating of your sauna.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/c26e040c5b5165764fe12c34a2c1bf29.poster.avif?t=1771570919\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/c26e040c5b5165764fe12c34a2c1bf29.webm?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/c26e040c5b5165764fe12c34a2c1bf29.mp4?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You should not forget about safety. If your stove is cheap, then it will have a high chance </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >of catching fire. In such cases you will need fire extinguishers, which of course you can </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >buy at the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/e9a560582e1139eccfc73b19c67817db.poster.avif?t=1771570919\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/e9a560582e1139eccfc73b19c67817db.webm?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/e9a560582e1139eccfc73b19c67817db.mp4?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspections. At a certain point, an inspection will come to you. The person will check the </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >condition of the fire extinguishers, the cleanliness of the premises, etc. Inspections can </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >be planned or unplanned. If your sauna has bad grades - unscheduled inspections will be </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >frequent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/ce3973dea9a185013cbb6ad346ec7e59.poster.avif?t=1771570919\" width=600 height=226 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/ce3973dea9a185013cbb6ad346ec7e59.webm?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/ce3973dea9a185013cbb6ad346ec7e59.mp4?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is developing now by only one person - S1NGLE.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2978940?t=1771570919","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2978940?t=1771570919","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/3535b7526eb0f2be5ae440807539a23aad289701/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771570919","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/3535b7526eb0f2be5ae440807539a23aad289701/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771570919","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3944220,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h1>ADD TO WISHLIST</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.poster.avif?t=1771570919\" width=736 height=100 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2978940/extras/9d9b37be1384de8495408ed26bbe0576.webm?t=1771570919\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"